        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Julia Compton Moore, Hal Moore\n- Roles: United States Army officer, lieutenant general, author\n- Organizations: United States Army, West Point\n- Awards: Distinguished Service Cross\n\nFacts:\n- Hal Moore was born on February 13, 1922, and he died on February 10, 2017.\n- Julia Compton Moore was born on February 10, 1929, and she died on April 18, 2004.\n- Hal Moore was a United States Army lieutenant general and author.\n- Julia Compton Moore was the wife of Hal Moore.\n- Hal Moore was a United States Army officer.\n- Hal Moore received the Distinguished Service Cross, the second-highest U.S. military decoration for valor.\n- Hal Moore was the first member of the West Point class of 1945 to be promoted to brigadier general, major general, and lieutenant general.",
